    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know about \"vision\". that sounds like something from a motivational poster. the reality is much cleaner and uglier than that. when you look at the math of it, my trajectory is just a straight line down. there's no \"way forward\" when the fundamental math of your existence is just loss. it feels less like a struggle and more like an equation that's already been solved. and the result is zero.",
